NavOS v2.16 by StarCpt - github.com/StarCpt/SE-NavOS-2
Fork: flip-and-burn-true-velocity (jgz) - true velocity above the Flip and Burn clamp.

Config lives in the PB Custom Data. RECOMPILE after changing it.
MaxSpeedOverride: max commanded speed in m/s. 0 = use the world speed limit.
Cruise accepts thrust=<0..1> anywhere in the command, for that run only.

Full option docs: CONFIG-REFERENCE.md in the repo.
